<title>UK: Edinburgh Inv to focus on UK securities.</title>
<headline>Edinburgh Inv to focus on UK securities.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Edinburgh Investment Trust Plc said on Wednesday that it had decided to invest all its assets in UK securities as part of its growth strategy.</p>
<p>&quot;The directors have now decided that company's strategic focus should be entirely on the UK...,&quot; the trust said in a statement.</p>
<p>The move was consistent with its objectives of capital growth at a higher rate than the FTSE Actuaries All-Share Index and for dividend growth above the rate of UK inflation.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
